  "body": {
    "en": [
      {
        "_key": "b40df",
        "_type": "tldrBox",
        "items": [
          "A redesign only kills traffic when **URLs change without redirects** or ranking content disappears.",
          "The golden rule: change the design, **keep the addresses and the meaning**",
          "A mandatory 301 map + 30 days of Search Console monitoring after launch",
          "The Efedra case: redesign + migration = traffic didn't dip, it quadrupled in 6 months"
        ],
        "title": "In 60 seconds"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40dg",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40dh",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Where the \"redesign kills traffic\" fear comes from — and when it's justified"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40di",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40dj",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Stories of \"we refreshed the site and traffic vanished\" are everywhere, and they're real. But it's not the new design that kills — it's a careless move: ranking pages vanished or moved to new addresses without redirects; the copy people found you by got \"cleaned up for beauty\". Google doesn't punish a new look — it simply loses what it knew about you."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40dk",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40dl",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Five rules of a safe redesign"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40do",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40dm",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Keep URLs where you can. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40dn",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A page's old address is its accumulated history. There's no reason to change /services/implants \"for style\"."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40dr",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40dp",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "If addresses change — a 301 map. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40dq",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Every old URL → its matching new one. Not wholesale to the home page — page by page."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40du",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40ds",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Preserve the meaning of working pages. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40dt",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Check Search Console for the pages bringing traffic, and don't rewrite their H1s and topics beyond recognition."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40dx",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40dv",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Don't lose speed. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40dw",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A new design with heavy animation can be slower than the old one — and speed is a ranking factor."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40e0",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40dy",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Monitor for 30 days. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40dz",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Search Console daily for the first month: indexing errors and sagging pages show immediately, while they're still easy to recover."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40e1",
        "_type": "blogImage",
        "alt": "Sketches of a new website design on paper",
        "asset": {
          "_ref": "image-861c49b3271ce43c3af59f38aaa1a18e739c56be-1600x1067-jpg",
          "_type": "reference"
        },
        "caption": "A new design starts on paper — a safe redesign starts with a map of the old URLs"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40e2",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40e3",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Redesign, migration, or a new site?"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40e4",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40e5",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A redesign is a new look on the same platform. A migration is a move to another platform (say, WordPress to custom code) with content and addresses preserved. In practice they usually happen together: the platform aged, and so did the design. That's fine — the rules are the same, the redirect map is just bigger."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40e6",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40e7",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Case: Efedra — the redesign after which traffic grew"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40ec",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40e8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The clinic moved off an old site with a full change of design and structure. We preserved the working meaning, built the redirect map, and monitored Search Console after launch. Six months on: 1,460 visits versus 340 — traffic never dipped for a single week. Full breakdown — "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40ea",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "b40e9"
            ],
            "text": "in the case study"
          },
          {
